  "title": "Techindustry",
  "description": "With this mod you can experiment with many new components for automation. You can build rockets to explore the solar system and land on other planetary bodies and you can even build space stations.",
  "body": "With this mod you can experiment with many new components for automation. You can build rockets to explore the solar system and land on other planetary bodies and you can even build space stations.\n\nPatreon: https://www.patreon.com/Swaix\n\nKo-Fi: https://ko-fi.com/swaix\n\nSupport Server: https://discord.gg/FwC2c6u3Jt\n\nFly to planets!\nmine ores with quarries\nautomate\nget quantum armor\nMain mods:\n\n- Create Fabric - start a factory and automate with this amazing addition\n\n- Ad Astra - so you can fly to other planets\n\n- Applied Energistics 2 - for advanced and ordered storage of your items\n\n- Traveler's Backpack [Fabric]\n\n- Modern Industrialization - advanced technology, automatic mines\n\n- MinecraftCapes Mod\n\nA small modpack for you and your friends, have fun!",
